      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "No scored fat section here. Saturated fat, omega 3, polyunsaturated fat, and cholesterol are not applicable because this is not a fat-based drink. For soft drinks, fat is not the issue; the ranking turns on sugar and what else the drink brings.",
