      "index": 3,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "carbs",
      "text": "10.6 grams of carbs. Sugar is 10.6 grams, so the carb load is basically sweet drink energy. Glycemic index is 63, which is not a steady-carb mark. Fibre is 0 grams, and starch is 0 grams too, so there is no fullness, digestion, or steady-starch support. For soft drinks, the carb section matters a lot because sugar is usually the main event.",
