      "index": 5,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "vitamins",
      "text": "Vitamin C is 0% daily value, vitamin E is 0% daily value, and vitamin K is 0% daily value. There is no useful vitamin support here. For soft drinks, vitamins would only help if the drink brought something useful beyond sweetness, and regular cola does not.",
