    {
      "id": "07-minerals",
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "minerals",
      "text": "Magnesium is 0% daily value, potassium is 0% daily value, iron is 0% daily value, and zinc is 0% daily value. So the mineral section is empty too. For soft drinks, minerals only matter when the drink has a real electrolyte-style role, and this one does not.",
